#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:26
#: 2ce36bcd1c244ce580ee0b2956a7ea8c
msgid ""
"`ros2 param set` is picked up **without** reloading. These controllers "
"have no generic `add_on_set_parameters_callback` for the documented keys."
" Home / MoveJ / waist duration / MoveL are re-read with `get_parameter` "
"on the **next** matching state enter or command. HOLD thresholds are re-"
"read on HOLD enter and each HOLD `run`."
msgstr ""
"`ros2 param set` **无需**重新加载即可被拾取。这些控制器对已文档化的键没有通用的 "
"`add_on_set_parameters_callback`。Home / MoveJ / 腰部时长 / MoveL "
"在**下一次**进入匹配状态或收到匹配命令时用 `get_parameter` 重读。HOLD 阈值在进入 HOLD 以及每个 HOLD "
"`run` 时重读。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:26
#: ea57fb3fb86f46bbbdb5a6a2de6aacdd
msgid "**Startup only**"
msgstr "**仅启动**"

