"`9a1da3ba`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/libraries/arms_controller_common/src/FSM/StateHold.cpp)."
" They are **Runtime**: `StateHold::updateParam()` calls `get_parameter` "
"on HOLD enter and each HOLD `run`. MIX HOLD impedance (`default_gains`) "
"stays on the OCS2 Arm table."
msgstr ""
"**Basic Joint Controller** 与 **OCS2 Arm Controller** 都 `auto_declare` "
"这些键（默认 `0.1`），并使用 `arms_controller_common::StateHold`。行为见 [`9a1da3ba` 上的 "
"`StateHold.cpp`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48/libraries/arms_controller_common/src/FSM/StateHold.cpp)。它们是**运行时**：`StateHold::updateParam()`"
" 在进入 HOLD 以及每个 HOLD `run` 时调用 `get_parameter`。MIX 下 HOLD "
"阻抗（`default_gains`）仍写在 OCS2 Arm 自己的表里。"

