msgstr "double / `0.1`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:26
#: f3a088cf11e44297ae4706709ec521a3
msgid ""
"First HOLD check after enter (measured vs hold targets). If any joint "
"exceeds this, retarget hold to current measured positions to avoid a "
"startup jump, then mark the first check passed. `≤ 0` skips the first "
"check. **Runtime**."
msgstr ""
"进入 HOLD 后的首次检查（实测位置相对保持目标）。任一关节超过此阈值时，把保持目标改成当前实测位置以避免启动跳变，并标记首次检查已通过。`≤ "
"0` 跳过首次检查。**运行时**。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:26
#: d6bc1a02382d4729b291ecec36efc75f
msgid "`hold_position_threshold`"
msgstr "`hold_position_threshold`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md:26
#: a73ea877a4bb4f34a2b4feaa1c691756
msgid ""
"After the first check has passed, if measured vs hold target exceeds "
"this, retarget hold to current measured positions. `≤ 0` disables "
"automatic adjustment. **Runtime**."
msgstr "首次检查通过后，若实测位置相对保持目标超过此阈值，把保持目标改成当前实测位置。`≤ 0` 关闭自动调整。**运行时**。"

